# The sha256 of every migration, as the databases that ran it keep it (schema_migrations.sha256).
# tests/log/test_migrations.py holds each file to its line, so a landed migration edited in a
# pull request fails CI here instead of stopping a gateway at startup. Adding a migration means
# appending its line, in the same commit that bumps migrations.lock.
